* Protection part models for lna-final (small-signal/capacitance-accurate, not surge-qualified).
* SP4022-01FTG-C: bidirectional TVS, 12 V working, 1.3 pF typ (Littelfuse). Back-to-back junctions.
.subckt SP4022 A K
DA A n DSP4022
DK K n DSP4022
.ends SP4022
.model DSP4022 D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=0.5 BV=13.3 IBV=1m CJO=2.6p VJ=0.7 M=0.33)
* SMBJ15A-class unidirectional TVS on the 12 V input
.model DTVS D(BV=16.7 IBV=1m CJO=300p RS=0.2)
* BAV99 junction (Nexperia: <=1.5 pF at 0 V)
.model DBAV99 D(IS=2.5n N=1.75 RS=0.5 CJO=1.5p VJ=0.5 M=0.33 BV=100 IBV=100n TT=4n)
